.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt RANDD 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm randd
.Nd RavenBSD pseudo-random device server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
registers the
.Dq rand:
scheme.
Reads return pseudo-random bytes from a ChaCha20-based generator and writes mix their input into
the generator state.
.Pp
The generator is seeded from the monotonic clock and a stack address and re-seeded from the clock
every 64 KiB.
.Sy It is not cryptographically secure.
Until a real entropy source exists, applications must not use
.Dq rand:
for keys, nonces or other secrets.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/services.d -compact
.It Pa /etc/services.d/randd.toml
Service manifest.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zerod 8 ,
.Xr nulld 8 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
